# Plugin run output written into the repository root by accident. An 11 KB
# dry-run report from 2026-06-20 (message.txt) had sat here untracked for
# weeks; untracked is not safe, because a `git add -A` sweeps it in. The file
# itself is left alone -- this only stops it, and the next one, being committed.
message.txt
*_dry_run_*.csv
*_Dry_Run_*.csv

# Internal planning / design docs are TRACKED (un-ignored 2026-07-18).
# They cannot reach end users regardless: release zips are built from the
# INNER folder (git archive HEAD:Event-Channel-Managarr), so nothing at the
# repo root is ever packaged. Versioning them is the point -- a design that
# only exists in a scratch directory is knowledge waiting to be lost.
